{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26482492\",\n      \"design\": \"病例报告（单例、双盲随机评估；Letter）\",\n      \"population\": \"晚期帕金森病患者，伴严重冻结步态（FOG），常规治疗难以控制\",\n      \"n\": \"1\",\n      \"condition\": \"接受丘脑底核/黑质网状部（STN/SNr）区域单侧交错式深部脑刺激（unilateral interleaved DBS）。摘要未报告具体刺激参数、药物状态及任务范式。\",\n      \"measure\": \"FOG临床表现及其对单侧交错式DBS的反应；摘要未说明具体评估量表或客观步态测量方法。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在该单例患者中，针对STN/SNr区域的单侧交错式DBS显著改善了严重FOG。论文题目报告该改善具有可逆性。\",\n      \"effect\": \"FOG显著改善，效应方向为症状减轻；未报告定量效应量。该结果提示调节STN/SNr区域可能影响FOG，但不能证明特定STN内源性神经活动与FOG之间的相关关系。\",\n      \"limitations\": \"样本量仅1例，外推性有限；刺激靶区同时涉及STN和SNr，无法区分两个核团各自对FOG改善的贡献；没有报告STN局部场电位（LFP）、频段功率或神经元放电记录，因此不能确定FOG改善对应何种STN神经活动变化；摘要未提供药物状态、刺激频率、脉宽、刺激强度及具体FOG评估指标，难以与其他STN神经生理研究直接比较。\",\n      \"quote\": \"unilateral interleaved deep brain stimulation in the subthalamic nucleus/substantia nigra pars reticulata region significantly improved freezing of gait\",\n      \"basis\": \"abstract\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8e40acb-239a-4252-9630-3950cff4c157", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T171734851395Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T17:17:59.046645+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "457039da061328466207f5dd5a225f42b7a1a88a1f119f161622bddc8039e8d8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b4